    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step panel"><span class="step-n">1</span><h3>Look first</h3><p class="muted">A free check-up of your network, devices and accounts.</p></li>
      <li class="step panel"><span class="step-n">2</span><h3>Straight answers</h3><p class="muted">What is covered, what is not, and what it costs.</p></li>
      <li class="step panel"><span class="step-n">3</span><h3>Fix the basics</h3><p class="muted">We close the biggest gaps before anything else.</p></li>
      <li class="step panel"><span class="step-n">4</span><h3>Run it for you</h3><p class="muted">Day-to-day support, plus a review every quarter.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
